            "lines": [
              242,
              249
            ],
            "conclusion": "For a `Selected` history, by decreasing induction using `Transfer` equality of `eval` with `push`, `push_integral` and the Wilson start `bare`, the integral of `rep N p m` against the Haar prior equals `partition` at `β N p N` for every m <= N."
